# CASE WHEN

## Simple Definition

CASE WHEN works like IF-ELSE.

---

# Syntax

```sql
SELECT
CASE
     WHEN condition THEN value
     WHEN condition THEN value
     ELSE value
END
FROM table_name;
```

---

# Example 1

Price Category

```sql
SELECT product_name,
       price,
       CASE
            WHEN price >= 15
            THEN 'Expensive'
            ELSE 'Affordable'
       END AS Category
FROM Menu;
```

---

# Example 2

Membership Status

```sql
SELECT s.customer_id,
       CASE
            WHEN m.join_date IS NULL
            THEN 'Non Member'
            ELSE 'Member'
       END AS Membership_Status
FROM Sales s
LEFT JOIN Members m
ON s.customer_id = m.customer_id;
```

---

