# Interview Questions

## Difference Between PK and FK

| Primary Key | Foreign Key |
|------------|------------|
| Unique | Can Repeat |
| No NULL | NULL Allowed |
| Identifies Row | References Another Table |

---

## Difference Between INNER and LEFT JOIN

| INNER JOIN | LEFT JOIN |
|------------|------------|
| Only Matches | All Left Rows |
| Removes Unmatched | Keeps Unmatched |

---

## Why Duplicate Rows Appear?

Because one row matches multiple rows in another table.

Usually occurs in 1:M relationships.

